patches/sonic-capture.patch modifies NVIDIA GR00T-WholeBodyControl source
(Apache-2.0). It adds simulation startup/history initialization, measured-state
logging, recording controls, Revo2 hand mapping, and orderly simulation stop.
The patch is based on commit 7f151314d4d1606544bf249d2a7a1cb754c64582.
NVIDIA's original copyright and license are retained in
licenses/NVIDIA-SONIC-LICENSE. Its model-weight license is separate; no model
weights are redistributed here.

assets/collection_reference_2609 contains a small source/schema compatibility
snapshot, including NVIDIA-derived source and Hugging Face LeRobot utilities.
Original notices remain in the files and its LICENSE; reference.json records
repositories, revisions and hashes. This directory is not a model or dataset.

Robot models, supermarket scenes, textures, motion data, initial-state arrays,
Isaac Sim/Lab, XRoboToolkit and SONIC weights are downloaded or installed
separately and remain subject to their respective terms. This project's
Apache-2.0 license does not relicense these external resources.
